# Assignment 12 - Sara7a App (Week 3)
1. **File Upload**: Multer diskStorage for uploading profile pictures.
2. **Email Service**: Nodemailer integration with OTP confirmation.
3. **Redis**: Token revocation (blacklist) on logout and temporary OTP caching.

## Run
1. \
pm install\
2. \
pm start\
3. Import \Assignment12.postman_collection.json\
"@ | Out-File -FilePath "D:\Assignments\assignment-12\README.md" -Encoding utf8

# .gitignore
@"
node_modules/
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep
.env
